		aliases = { "Wild duck", "Anas platyrhynchos" },
		summary = "The **mallard** or **wild duck** (**Anas platyrhynchos**) is a dabbling duck that breeds throughout the temperate and subtropical [[Americas]], [[Eurasia]], and [[North Africa]]. It has been [[Introduced species|introduced]] to [[New Zealand]], [[Australia]], [[Peru]], [[Brazil]], [[Uruguay]], [[Argentina]], [[Chile]], [[Colombia]], the [[Falkland Islands]], and [[South Africa]]. Belonging to the [[Subfamily|subfamily]] Anatinae of the waterfowl family Anatidae, mallards live in [[Wetland|wetlands]], eat water plants and small animals, and are social animals preferring to congregate in groups or flocks of varying sizes.",
